and expl. voce <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَصْحَرَ</span>: said by IAth to be derived
from <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَقْرٌ</span> in the phrase <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَقْرُ الدَّارِ</span>. (TA.)

